"Export RGB preference override" = "导出优先使用 RGB 的 override";
"Exporting does not install the override or change the display." = "导出只保存文件，不安装 override，也不更改显示设置。";
"Override exported. Display settings are unchanged." = "已导出 override，显示设置未更改。";
"Install RGB preference override?" = "安装优先使用 RGB 的 override？";
"An existing override will be backed up. This applies to displays with the same vendor and product IDs. Administrator approval is required. Reconnect afterwards; RGB Full Range is not guaranteed." = "安装前会备份现有 override。此设置可能影响厂商 ID 和产品 ID 相同的显示器，安装需要管理员授权。完成后请重新连接显示器；不能保证 RGB Full Range 输出。";
"Install" = "安装";
"Override file installed and read back. Reconnect the display, then verify its output. Full Range remains unverified." = "override 文件已安装并回读核对。请重新连接显示器后验证实际输出，Full Range 尚未验证。";
"Restore the original override?" = "恢复原始 override？";
"The app will restore its backup, or remove its installed file if no override existed before. External changes will not be overwritten. Reconnect the display afterwards." = "应用会恢复备份；如果安装前没有 override，则移除本应用安装的文件。外部修改不会被覆盖。完成后请重新连接显示器。";
"Restore" = "恢复";
"The previous override was restored. Reconnect the display to reload its configuration." = "已恢复安装前的 override 状态。请重新连接显示器以加载配置。";
"Cancel" = "取消";
"The administrator operation failed." = "管理员操作未成功。";
"The override or its backup record needs review before installation or restoration." = "覆盖文件或备份记录需要检查，暂时无法安全安装或恢复。";
"The override directory has an unsupported owner, permissions or symbolic link. It has not been changed." = "覆盖目录的所有者、权限或符号链接不符合要求，未作修改。";
"A previous operation needs restoration. Restore the backup state before installing again." = "上次操作尚未完成恢复，请先恢复备份状态，再重新安装。";

